      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.93,
          "end": 5.05,
          "en": "So we worked a lot on resetting passwords.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.08,
          "end": 7.51,
          "en": "Let's now work on authorization.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.51,
          "end": 13.78,
          "en": "And with that, I mean that not every authenticated user is allowed to do everything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 14.14,
          "end": 16.12,
          "en": "A good example would be this one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 16.3,
          "end": 17.56,
          "en": "I'm not logged in now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.56,
          "end": 19.63,
          "en": "Let me log in with this user here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.17,
          "end": 21.52,
          "en": "Test a test dot com.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.17,
          "end": 30.13,
          "en": "Here, I might be able to add a product and I can delete products, but right now I can delete all products",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 30.13,
          "end": 33.82,
          "en": "no matter if I created them or if someone else created them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.82,
          "end": 35.89,
          "en": "And the same is true for editing them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.21,
          "end": 44.77,
          "en": "Authorization means that I restrict the permissions of a logged in user, so every user might be able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 44.77,
          "end": 48.76,
          "en": "to add anything to the card, including products created by the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 48.91,
          "end": 53.62,
          "en": "But you might not be able to delete and edit products which were not created by you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 53.89,
          "end": 60.37,
          "en": "So for now, I can do that, but that's exactly what I want to work on next so that we can't do this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 60.52,
          "end": 62.62,
          "en": "Now, how can we implement that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 63.31,
          "end": 69.52,
          "en": "Well, when I create a new product and let me quickly do that, remember, I'm locked in with test at",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 69.52,
          "end": 70.97,
          "en": "test com.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 72.15,
          "end": 77.38,
          "en": "This was created by test at test dotcom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 77.4,
          "end": 82.7,
          "en": "When I create this product here, we have it here and we can see it in the product collection.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 82.71000000000001,
          "end": 88.17,
          "en": "Obviously it's linked to the user with an ID that ends with E five.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 88.17,
          "end": 92.97,
          "en": "And if we have a look at all our users, let me delete this one here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 93.45,
          "end": 95.3,
          "en": "Then we see this is the one with E five.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 95.31,
          "end": 97.25999999999999,
          "en": "It is to test a test dot com user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 97.59,
          "end": 102.12,
          "en": "Now if I log in with my test to account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 103.08,
          "end": 104.75999999999999,
          "en": "So test to here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 107.08,
          "end": 109.50999999999999,
          "en": "Then if I go to Avon products.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 110.38,
          "end": 114.21000000000001,
